Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.98,0:00:07.36,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\b1\fnArial\shad0\c&H5ABBC6&\3c&H5D5D65&}Kinme Cleaning
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.98,0:00:07.36,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Stain removal is essentially \Nall about chemistry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.99,0:00:13.12,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Apply the correct solutions to the layers \Nof the stain in the right order...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.12,0:00:15.12,Default,Kiito/Nairo/Tao,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.79,0:00:20.25,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,And see? That's how you can \Ncompletely remove a stain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.25,0:00:21.47,Default,Tao,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.47,0:00:22.71,Default,Kiito,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.71,0:00:27.51,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Question! Where do you buy \Nthe detergents that you use?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.91,0:00:33.38,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I always buy them from a salesman \Nwho comes to visit once a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.38,0:00:34.26,Default,Kiito,0,0,0,,Question!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.66,0:00:40.52,Default,Kiito,0,0,0,,Does he have to come here in person? \NCan't you buy them online instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.52,0:00:44.40,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.67,0:00:52.41,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I believe I've heard that you can, \Nbut I don't know how to use the internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.41,0:00:55.00,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Oh. Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.00,0:00:58.19,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,You really don't know \Nhow to use the internet?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.38,0:01:21.48,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimesNewRoman\shad0\fs36\c&HB8B74C&\3c&HFBFFFE&\an7\frz8.498\\clip(160,82,167,129)\t(16,893,1 \clip(153,76,280,123))\pos(164,88)\fad(1,187)}Wash {\c&H121A2E&}It
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.36,0:01:21.48,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimesNewRoman\shad0\fs36\3c&HFBFFFE&\an7\frz8.498\clip(269,73,271,114)\pos(282,71)\fad(1,187)\clip(267,73,276,116)\t(6,1007,1,\clip(275,58,417,107)\c&H121A2E&}All Away
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.55,0:02:34.51,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(481,478)\fs13\shad2\c&H222C04&\3c&HEEDCCF&\blur0\bord1\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\4c&HC7CD96&\pos(147,64)}Episode {\c&H8065C7&}7   {\c&H222C04&}You Should Leverage Your {\c&H8F8B3E&}Assets{\c&H222C04&}!!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.57,0:02:35.63,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,Thank you for taking time out of \Nyour busy schedule to see us today!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.16,0:02:39.26,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Are you sure this wasn't \Ntoo much of a distraction?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.57,0:02:44.26,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Not at all. You caught me \Nright when work was slow,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.26,0:02:48.40,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,and I'm happy to help out \Nwith your summer research projects.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.40,0:02:52.14,Default,Kiito,0,0,0,,Nairo-chan is always studying.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.14,0:02:53.11,Default,Tao,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.11,0:02:56.91,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Yes! I love to study things!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.30,0:03:08.42,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,Nairo-chan's grandmother sent \Nthese over as a gift. They're so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.42,0:03:14.04,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,Little top snails. They're kind of crunchy\N but still tender and so creamy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.53,0:03:18.11,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Come in!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.86,0:03:21.18,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Hello, Sumiyaki-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.18,0:03:24.93,Default,Sumiyaki,0,0,0,,Hi, Kinme-san. It's nice to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.29,0:03:28.05,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,May I ask you to wait here \Nfor just a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.05,0:03:29.06,Default,Sumiyaki,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.60,0:03:34.92,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Sorry, girls. The salesman arrived, \Nso please wait in here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.88,0:03:38.62,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,The salesman is here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.70,0:03:43.14,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,My apologies! Thank you for waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.14,0:03:44.50,Default,Sumiyaki,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.83,0:03:48.03,Default,Sumiyaki,0,0,0,,I've brought you the latest catalog.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.03,0:03:50.46,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.66,0:03:56.44,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm running out of\N plastic garment bags.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.44,0:03:58.22,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Could I order some more?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.22,0:04:00.86,Default,Sumiyaki,0,0,0,,Sure. I'll put you down for some.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.86,0:04:06.85,Default,Sumiyaki,0,0,0,,By the way, Kinme-san, do you use social \Nmedia or text messaging for your business?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.85,0:04:09.98,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh? Social...?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.98,0:04:12.76,Default,Sumiyaki,0,0,0,,A kind of online advertising.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.76,0:04:15.86,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, I see. On-line...?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.86,0:04:17.86,Default,Sumiyaki,0,0,0,,Take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.86,0:04:22.10,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\fnArial\shad0\move(73,77,73,-30)\fs20\3c&HAF7C61&\c&HFBF9F1&}Kamasu Sales, Ltd.
