Dialogue: 1,0:04:27.86,0:04:29.16,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.62,0:04:33.28,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I wonder if I actually \Nneed something like that, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.28,0:04:36.01,Default,Sumiyaki,0,0,0,,Oh, you really can't get by \Nwithout it these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.01,0:04:44.89,sign_6618_70_National_Cleanin,text,0,0,0,,National Cleaning Newspaper\NScenes from the Cleaning Industry
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.41,0:04:39.90,Default,Sumiyaki,0,0,0,,The trade papers are full of \Narticles talking about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.90,0:04:44.89,Default,Sumiyaki,0,0,0,,In today's world, everyone knows it's best\N to attract new customers online.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.89,0:04:46.57,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.89,0:04:51.22,Default,Sumiyaki,0,0,0,,If you rely on old-school \Nsnail mail and flyers,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.22,0:04:53.77,Default,Sumiyaki,0,0,0,,you'll end up severely \Nlimiting your reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.77,0:04:55.36,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.77,0:05:02.46,Default,Sumiyaki,0,0,0,,Besides clothes, don't you clean other \Nkinds of leather and fabric items too?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.46,0:05:04.16,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Uh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.16,0:05:08.45,Default,Sumiyaki,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, didn't you recently \Nwash a fishing banner and doll?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.45,0:05:10.62,Default,Sumiyaki,0,0,0,,I hear your customers were very pleased.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.62,0:05:14.21,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,W-Well, I try to do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.39,0:05:18.42,Default,Sumiyaki,0,0,0,,Kinme-san, as a small business,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.42,0:05:22.66,Default,Sumiyaki,0,0,0,,you're able to bring a personal touch \Nand great care to your stain removal work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.66,0:05:27.81,Default,Sumiyaki,0,0,0,,On top of that, you're blessed with \Na fine personality and the looks to match!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.68,0:05:33.50,Default,Sumiyaki,0,0,0,,You should get online so you can \Ndraw more attention to those qualities
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.50,0:05:36.69,Default,Sumiyaki,0,0,0,,and really start to leverage your assets!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.00,0:05:39.86,Default,Sumiyaki,0,0,0,,I think if you leverage \Nthose assets better,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.86,0:05:44.70,Default,Sumiyaki,0,0,0,,it will immediately put you on track \Nfor massive new customer growth!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.37,0:05:50.20,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I'm just not very good \Nwith the internet to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.21,0:05:55.03,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,I know! Why don't you let me handle that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.03,0:05:57.21,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh? Nairo-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.21,0:06:00.28,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,My friends and I can \Nhelp you with the net.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.28,0:06:01.17,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.59,0:06:04.88,Default,Sumiyaki,0,0,0,,My, what darling little \Nsupporters you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.88,0:06:07.58,Default,Sumiyaki,0,0,0,,I'm Sumiyaki from sales.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.58,0:06:11.43,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,I'm Katakuchi Nairo from Kinomiya \NElementary School, third grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.43,0:06:14.28,Default,Kiito,0,0,0,,I'm her classmate Mebaru Kiito.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.28,0:06:15.66,Default,Tao,0,0,0,,I'm Kasago Tao.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.66,0:06:17.98,Default,Sumiyaki,0,0,0,,Very pleased to meet you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.98,0:06:21.11,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,But help out? How?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.11,0:06:24.08,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Kii-chan knows a lot about the internet,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.08,0:06:28.18,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,so I think she can help you set up \Na social media account.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.18,0:06:29.18,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.18,0:06:29.99,Default,Kiito,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.28,0:06:35.41,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,And I'll take promotional pictures \Nof you hard at work, Kinme-oneesan,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.41,0:06:38.25,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,as your in-house cameraman!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.25,0:06:39.39,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.39,0:06:43.34,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,But I'm not sure if I should \Nmake you do all that for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.34,0:06:46.51,Default,Sumiyaki,0,0,0,,Why not? You might be \Nsurprised by the results.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.78,0:06:50.69,Default,Sumiyaki,0,0,0,,Also, school girls teaming up \Nwith a cleaning shop lady
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.69,0:06:52.18,Default,Sumiyaki,0,0,0,,sounds like a really unique crossover!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.18,0:06:56.65,Default,Sumiyaki,0,0,0,,It doesn't take much to get started, \Nso why not at least give it a shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.65,0:07:02.65,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Hmm. I do usually start to get \Nfewer drop-offs around this time of year.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.36,0:07:08.69,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I don't know if it'll \Nmake a big difference,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.69,0:07:11.16,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,but maybe I will give it a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.74,0:07:13.41,Default,Sumiyaki,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.41,0:07:18.83,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I'll talk to your parents, \Nand as long as they say it's okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.83,0:07:21.42,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,would you be willing \Nto lend me your expertise?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.42,0:07:22.50,Default,Kiito/Nairo/Tao,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.50,0:07:26.93,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, just be careful not to take \Nany pictures of my face, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.39,0:07:28.82,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.82,0:07:31.32,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,You can count on Nairo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.93,0:07:37.94,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\b1\fnArial\shad0\c&H5ABBC6&\3c&H5D5D65&}Kinme Cleaning
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.39,0:07:41.19,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,I shall now begin \Ntaking photos of you at work!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.19,0:07:44.44,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,All right! I am in your capable hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.76,0:07:46.37,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Okay, without hesitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.37,0:07:46.95,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.45,0:07:54.97,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I really don't want any pictures \Nof my face, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.97,0:07:57.28,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Understood! I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.14,0:08:27.40,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Hey! I don't think \Nwe need pictures like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.40,0:08:30.61,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Candid shots are an absolute \Nnecessity on social media!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.99,0:08:34.80,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Um, I have to go out\N and make deliveries now,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.80,0:08:36.87,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,so maybe we should call it a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.78,0:08:42.38,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Deliveries?! On the contrary, that would \Nbe the {\i1}perfect{\i0} photo opportunity!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.38,0:08:43.88,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,I will go with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.88,0:08:45.21,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.63,0:08:48.17,Default,Kiito,0,0,0,,We'll be waiting here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.25,0:09:16.79,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,I have a great idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.95,0:09:26.68,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Just like that, Kinme-oneesan!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.05,0:09:30.14,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,You're perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.55,0:09:36.93,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I-Is this sort of thing \Nreally that eye-catching?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.93,0:09:40.68,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Yes! This is how everyone \Non social media does it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.68,0:09:43.52,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,With the castle in frame, it's perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.97,0:10:22.48,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fs10\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\pos(214,202)\c&H49656C&\3c&H7CB0BD&}Men's Bath
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.97,0:10:22.48,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fs8\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\c&H49656C&\3c&H7CB8C7&\pos(413.286,202)}Women's Bath\h\h\h\hWomen's Bath
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.81,0:10:24.89,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,Today was a little overwhelming.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.31,0:10:29.78,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,Once Nairo-chan gets started on \Nsomething, there's no stopping her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.99,0:10:34.07,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh. Good evening!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.29,0:10:37.96,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Here you are again!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.74,0:10:42.10,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Nairo-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.00,0:10:47.88,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Please stay right there! \NI'll go get my camera!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.88,0:10:52.26,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh? I-I don't need any pictures \Nof me in the bath!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.88,0:10:55.88,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an9\b1\fnArial\shad0\c&H74D4D2&\3c&H7E5E2C&}Kinme Cleaning
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.89,0:11:01.01,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,It actually looks professionally made!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.01,0:11:03.73,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an9\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\fs20\blur2\c&H000000&\3c&HFFFFFF&}For all of your precious\Ngarments and accessories
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.01,0:11:03.27,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\fs20\blur2\c&H000000&\3c&HFFFFFF&}You can count\Non Kinme.
