Dialogue: 1,0:11:09.04,0:11:11.38,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\fnArial\shad0\fs20\3c&HFCFDFD&\c&HADADB1&fsp1\frz357.3\fsp2\pos(21,38)}Home  Posts  Reviews  {\c&HB29590&\b1}Pictures{\b0}  {\c&H7B7B7E&}Videos  Community
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.29,0:11:03.26,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Didn't Kii-chan do great?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.26,0:11:08.30,Default,Kiito,0,0,0,,Well, Nairo-chan and Tao-chan did good \Nwork on the photo editing and copy too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.30,0:11:10.90,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Hmm? What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.69,0:11:13.84,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Snapshots of your day-to-day life.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.84,0:11:16.13,Default,Kiito,0,0,0,,Those are really crucial, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.13,0:11:17.41,Default,Tao,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:20.03,0:11:23.86,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,{\an8}Is this me cleaning the stain here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.16,0:11:24.91,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\p1\bord0\an8\shad0\c&HFDFEFE&\frz359.9\fscx238\fscy55\move(322.5,353,322.5,184,21,2732)}m 0 0 l 230 0 l 230 215 l 0 215
Dialogue: 1,0:11:22.16,0:11:24.91,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\fnArial\shad0\fs20\3c&HFFFFFF&\c&H6D6C8D&\move(66,361,67,212,21,2732)}Here is Kinme-san, the owner of Kinme Cleaning, treating a \Nstain on a customer's garment! She works very carefully, \Napplying a series of detergents to safely remove the stain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.37,0:11:24.91,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\fnArial\shad0\fs20\3c&HFFFFFF&\c&H75797C&\move(178,333,178,300,22,522)}Comment
