Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.37,0:11:24.91,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\fnArial\shad0\fs20\3c&HFFFFFF&\c&H75797C&\move(507,328,507,299,22,522)}Share
Dialogue: 1,0:11:23.86,0:11:24.91,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,{\an8}Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.91,0:11:27.92,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,What a great shot. I'm impressed!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.92,0:11:34.25,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,So does that mean it's done,\N and we don't have to do anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.25,0:11:38.30,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,No, this is just the beginning. \NFirst, we need to get more followers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.30,0:11:39.95,Default - Top,Kinme,0,0,0,,Followers?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.95,0:11:42.74,Default - Top,Nairo,0,0,0,,Right here. It's like the number \Nof fans you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.74,0:11:47.64,Default - Top,Nairo,0,0,0,,When the number gets bigger, it means \Nmore people are watching your account.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.64,0:11:49.72,Default - Top,Nairo,0,0,0,,It's still at zero right now, though.
