Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.50,0:11:53.61,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I hope we get more soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.61,0:11:56.61,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,We'll keep updating the page regularly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.61,0:11:57.41,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.41,0:11:58.20,Default,Kiito/Tao,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.20,0:12:02.33,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Thank you very much. But don't \Nspend too much time on it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.33,0:12:03.51,Default,Kiito/Nairo/Tao,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.24,0:12:09.90,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Um, Aji-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.90,0:12:11.71,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,Hmm? What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.71,0:12:17.82,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I got someone to make an account for \Nthe shop on the internet a few days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.82,0:12:19.97,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Would you mind taking a look \Nwhen you get a chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.97,0:12:23.22,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,What the heck is that? \NSome kind of TV show?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.22,0:12:26.90,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Ah, not exactly. Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.90,0:12:29.60,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I can't explain it well myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.07,0:12:35.23,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,Why don't you try asking me \Nagain once you can?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.95,0:12:37.78,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I guess you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.14,0:12:47.41,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,A lot of my customers here \Nare elderly, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.29,0:12:51.75,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\p1\bord0\an8\shad0\c&HFFFFFF&\fad(935,1)\pos(111,58)\fscx88\fscy14}m 0 0 l 230 0 l 230 215 l 0 215
