Dialogue: 1,0:12:49.02,0:12:51.75,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,You still aren't getting \Na lot of followers yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.10,0:12:57.38,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,The only people following are \Nthe salesman and people he knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.46,0:13:01.38,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Well, maybe that's just the way it goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.12,0:13:05.81,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,I thought you'd have a lot more by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.81,0:13:08.88,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, it's fine. There's no rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.88,0:13:12.91,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Customer service work is never \Nthat easy to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.91,0:13:15.76,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Try not to let it bother you too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.12,0:13:23.53,Default,Delivery Man,0,0,0,,I have a delivery!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.53,0:13:25.00,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh! All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.82,0:13:28.52,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,A package?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.52,0:13:31.04,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Something for the shop \Nfrom another prefecture?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.04,0:13:32.80,Default,Delivery Man,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.35,0:13:35.04,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.76,0:13:40.33,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,"To Kinme-sama of Kinme Cleaning,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.33,0:13:43.61,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I sent this after seeing \Nyour Facenote page.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.61,0:13:49.81,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,No other cleaner would accept it. \NDo you think you can take care of this?"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.81,0:13:50.68,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.02,0:13:52.29,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.98,0:13:58.98,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\fs22\c&HC4C480&\3c&HFBFFFE&\an7\frz9.132\pos(90,254)}Wash {\c&0000000&}It All Away
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.98,0:14:03.99,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\fs22\c&HC4C480&\3c&HFBFFFE&\an7\frz9.132\pos(76,25)}Wash {\c&0000000&}It All Away
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.63,0:14:09.63,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Wow, so you started a Facenote page?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.62,0:14:14.26,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yes. Do you have a Face...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.26,0:14:16.38,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Um, do you have one of those too?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.38,0:14:22.13,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Nah, too much of a hassle for me. \NI'd rather keep my social life simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.46,0:14:25.66,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,But as busy you are, do you \Nhave time to keep it updated?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.66,0:14:27.84,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yes, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.59,0:14:33.64,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I don't really understand \Nthe social... media yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.64,0:14:37.65,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,so I have some schoolgirls from \Nthe neighborhood helping me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.97,0:14:39.70,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Schoolgirls from the neighborhood?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.70,0:14:41.34,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Who could that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.34,0:14:42.11,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.11,0:14:43.15,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.48,0:14:46.16,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,So, are you seeing results?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.16,0:14:53.66,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yes, I am. Someone already mailed me \Nan item to clean from another town.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.40,0:14:57.11,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,What? That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.54,0:15:02.66,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,{\t(5028,5445,\1c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}It's just, I wasn't expecting it at all, \Nso it was kind of a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.37,0:15:06.73,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,This one was in a condition \NI could work with,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.73,0:15:10.02,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,but I'm afraid I'll also get requests \Nthat are beyond my abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.60,0:15:13.44,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Yeah, I can see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.44,0:15:17.76,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,If people sent you an item out of the blue\N and complained when you decline,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.76,0:15:19.19,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,that wouldn't be much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.19,0:15:21.19,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.53,0:15:27.50,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,But I do find myself checking online \Nrecommendations a lot these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.50,0:15:29.54,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Especially for doctors and dentists.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.95,0:15:31.75,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Recommendations...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.75,0:15:34.54,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,You can't always expect word of mouth \Nto be accurate, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.54,0:15:36.40,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Especially for restaurant reviews.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.83,0:15:40.35,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Do you... pay attention to those?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.29,0:15:43.70,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Hey, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.70,0:15:47.33,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Even if there are cleaners out there\N with a better reputation,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.33,0:15:48.84,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,I'll always come to you instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.57,0:15:52.47,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.77,0:15:56.66,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,But if you do start getting busy \Nwith online orders,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.66,0:16:00.11,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,maybe you won't need to wash things \Nfor us locals anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.11,0:16:02.98,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,N-No, that would never happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.94,0:16:05.45,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,I'm just kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.45,0:16:07.52,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,See you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.52,0:16:09.24,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.25,0:16:13.19,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,Recommendations, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.55,0:16:18.33,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Kinme-oneesan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.33,0:16:20.44,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh? Nairo-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.15,0:16:22.52,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Your account is...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.41,0:16:26.60,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,b-blowing up right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.10,0:16:28.97,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.22,0:16:34.72,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\p1\bord0\an8\shad0\c&HFFFFFF&\fscx88\fscy14\pos(113,53)}m 0 0 l 230 0 l 230 215 l 0 215
Dialogue: 1,0:16:30.22,0:16:34.72,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\fnArial\shad0\fs30\3c&HFFFFFF&\c&H75797C&\pos(32,55)}Community
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.22,0:16:34.72,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\p1\bord0\an8\shad0\c&HFFFFFF&\fscx210\fscy17\pos(365,117)}m 0 0 l 230 0 l 230 215 l 0 215
Dialogue: 1,0:16:30.22,0:16:34.72,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\fnArial\shad0\fs28\3c&HFFFFFF&\c&H75797C&\pos(131,124)}2,402 People Have Liked This Page
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.22,0:16:34.72,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\p1\bord0\an8\shad0\c&HFFFFFF&\fscx192\fscy18\pos(354,177)}m 0 0 l 230 0 l 230 215 l 0 215
Dialogue: 1,0:16:30.22,0:16:34.72,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\fnArial\shad0\fs28\3c&HFFFFFF&\c&H75797C&\pos(131,179)}2,366 People Are Following This Page
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.22,0:16:34.72,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\p1\bord0\an8\shad0\c&HFFFFFF&\fscx88\fscy14\pos(114,339)}m 0 0 l 230 0 l 230 215 l 0 215
Dialogue: 1,0:16:30.61,0:16:32.37,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Take a look at this!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:32.37,0:16:33.27,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:33.67,0:16:34.72,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Two thousand?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.21,0:16:37.98,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,H-How did I get so many?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.98,0:16:41.50,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,It looks like it started with \Nthe person from before.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.03,0:16:44.90,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Person from before?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.23,0:16:53.24,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\p1\bord0\an8\shad0\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(538,25)\fscx85\fscy72}m 0 0 l 230 0 l 230 215 l 0 215
Dialogue: 1,0:16:45.23,0:16:53.24,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\fnArial\shad0\fs10\3c&HFFFFFF&\c&H65686A&\pos(440,44)}This hat holds a lot of memories for me.\NIt actually got so dirty that cleaners\Nwouldn't even touch it, but then I decided\Nto try my luck with a shop I found\Non Facenote. I had honestly given up,\Nbut look at it now. \N\NThe work was done by an independent\Nshop in Atami called {\u1\c&HFF3305&}Kinme Cleaning{\u0}. \N\N{\c&H65686A&}I'm so glad that they were able to clean it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.23,0:16:53.24,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\p1\bord0\an8\shad0\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(564,205)\fscx105\fscy42}m 0 0 l 230 0 l 230 215 l 0 215
Dialogue: 1,0:16:45.23,0:16:53.24,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\fnArial\shad0\fs10\3c&HFFFFFF&\c&H3E4143&\b1\pos(444,205.5)}OMU RAOO{\b0}  {\c&H65686A&}Wow! It looks brand new!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:45.23,0:16:53.24,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\fnArial\shad0\fs10\3c&HFFFFFF&\c&H3E4143&\b1\pos(444,230.5)}ra1112{\b0} {\c&H65686A&}I have a cardigan that I've kept\Nlocked away because it's so badly\Nstained. Does this Kinme Cleaning\Naccept online orders? Maybe I should\Ngive them a try too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.23,0:16:53.24,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\p1\bord0\an8\shad0\c&HFFFFFF&\fscx108\fscy7\pos(560,335)}m 0 0 l 230 0 l 230 215 l 0 215
Dialogue: 1,0:16:45.23,0:16:53.24,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\fnArial\shad0\fs12\3c&HFFFFFF&\c&H3E4143&\b1\pos(444,334.5)}2759 Likes
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.23,0:16:47.57,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh! It's that hat!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:47.57,0:16:51.16,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,This lady is actually a famous influencer!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:51.16,0:16:53.24,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,Her name is Maleko.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.24,0:16:55.83,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Influencer?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.83,0:16:59.25,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,A kind of online celebrity \Nthat a lot of people listen to.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.25,0:17:04.25,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\p1\bord0\an8\shad0\c&HFFFFFF&\frz350.8\pos(428,35)\fscx220\fscy151}m 0 0 l 230 0 l 230 215 l 0 215
Dialogue: 1,0:16:59.25,0:17:04.25,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\fnArial\shad0\fs30\3c&HFFFFFF&\c&H65686A&\pos(190,-4)\frz349.7}This hat holds a lot of memories for me.\NIt actually got so dirty that cleaners\Nwouldn't even touch it, but then I decided\Nto try my luck with a shop I found\Non Facenote. I had honestly given up,\Nbut look at it now. \N\NThe work was done by an independent\Nshop in Atami called {\u1\c&HFF3305&}Kinme Cleaning{\u0}. \N\N{\c&H65686A&}I'm so glad that they were able to clean it!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:59.25,0:17:03.89,Default,Nairo,0,0,0,,When this lady recommended your shop, \Nyou got a bunch of new followers!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.97,0:17:11.31,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Hello, this is Kinme Cleaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.39,0:17:17.27,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yes. So not a pick-up, but a mail order?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.27,0:17:19.26,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,What? From Hokkaido?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.65,0:17:24.77,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Are these all orders?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.41,0:17:29.79,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I'll have to check everything inside \Nand get back to the owners.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.65,0:17:33.08,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Hello, this is Kinme Cleaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.75,0:17:36.66,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,What?! You want to send an item from Saga?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.66,0:17:43.13,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I apologize for being so late today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.13,0:17:47.28,Default,Regular,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it, dear. \NAny time is fine with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.30,0:17:53.10,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,I'm telling ya, man, real angels exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.10,0:17:54.30,Default,Friend,0,0,0,,Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.10,0:17:54.30,Default - Top,Friend,0,0,0,,No way, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.99,0:17:57.06,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Oh! Kinme-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.79,0:17:59.89,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Good afternoon, Moruda-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.31,0:18:01.82,Default,Friend 1,0,0,0,,Oh, is that her?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.82,0:18:02.83,Default,Friend 2,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.83,0:18:06.38,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,I know, right? I told you she was pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.38,0:18:07.19,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.19,0:18:13.85,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,But wow, Kinme-san! \NYou actually got to clean Maleko's hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.85,0:18:16.70,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh? How did you know about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.70,0:18:20.59,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,I've been following Maleko for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.70,0:18:18.86,Default - Top,Friend 1,0,0,0,,She is an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.86,0:18:19.66,Default - Top,Friend 2,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.66,0:18:20.99,Default - Top,Friend 1,0,0,0,,I believe it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.99,0:18:21.58,Default - Top,Friend 2,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.59,0:18:24.04,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,But I mean, I didn't even know \Nyou were on Facenote.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.04,0:18:25.83,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Uh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.83,0:18:28.11,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,I just followed you too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.11,0:18:30.50,Default,Friend 2,0,0,0,,She's the real thing. Insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.50,0:18:34.52,Default,Moruda,0,0,0,,Hey, guys! You better not go bragging \Non Facenote that you met Kinme-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.52,0:18:36.80,Italics,Kinme,0,0,0,,The internet is incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.52,0:18:37.26,Default - Top,Moruda,0,0,0,,It's okay if you say you met \Nmy true older sister, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.26,0:18:38.47,Default - Top,Friend,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.48,0:18:46.52,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I am very sorry, but I am buried in orders \Nright now, so it may take extra time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.61,0:18:53.83,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yes, one or two days would be difficult. \NI'm very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.76,0:18:58.03,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Hello, this is Kinme Cleaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.32,0:19:01.80,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,What? A pick-up in Yokohama?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.80,0:19:05.72,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I'm very sorry, but I must decline.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.18,0:19:08.38,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yes. Please accept my apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.73,0:19:10.51,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Thank you. Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.28,0:19:14.85,Default,Delivery Man,0,0,0,,Got some packages for you. \NA whole bunch today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.85,0:19:15.84,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.67,0:19:58.18,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fs16\frz4.502\c&H78D2FC&\3c&H0C528E&\b1\pos(290,72)}Vacancies
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.67,0:19:58.18,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an9\shad0\fs26\c&H78D2FC&\3c&H04326B&\bord3}Yadoya's Thoughts\N\N{\fs18}I hurt my back as soon as I\Ngot up this morning.\NI couldn't move for 30 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.25,0:20:04.03,Italics,Kyusho (M),0,0,0,,This street has a lot more \Ntrendy shops now than it used to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.80,0:20:06.95,Italics,Kyusho (M),0,0,0,,Lots of, what's the word, renovations?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.85,0:20:10.87,Italics,Kyusho (M),0,0,0,,Maybe I should update too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.98,0:20:20.99,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Kyusho-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.99,0:20:21.66,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.20,0:20:24.32,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,K-Kinme-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.40,0:20:30.45,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I'm so glad I caught you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.96,0:20:34.96,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I saw you at the shop, \Nbut you turned around and left.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.96,0:20:37.63,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh... yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.09,0:20:43.32,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Moruda had already warned me, but you \Nlooked even busier than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.72,0:20:45.66,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,So I figured it could wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.39,0:20:47.90,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,No, it can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.90,0:20:48.85,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.85,0:20:51.01,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,It can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.68,0:20:52.85,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.67,0:20:56.42,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,you requested this quite a while ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.51,0:21:01.12,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,so your bag takes priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.39,0:21:06.74,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Kinme-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.74,0:21:07.75,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.06,0:21:11.75,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Did you mean to keep your apron on \Nwhen you left the shop?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.02,0:21:12.90,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.11,0:21:17.51,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,No, I didn't! I didn't even realize!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.51,0:21:20.12,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,But I was in such a rush...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.02,0:21:38.46,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Okay, then. Please take care of my bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.88,0:21:39.68,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.96,0:21:42.96,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,You can count on Kinme!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.87,0:21:56.84,Default,Credits,0,0,0,,{\an9\fad(353,354)\shad0\fnArial\fs10\bord1.5\c&H4A83BA&\3c&HF0FBFF&\b1\pos(443,293.467)}Translation:\NEditing and Typesetting:
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.87,0:21:56.84,Default,Credits,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(353,354)\shad0\fnArial\fs10\bord1.5\c&H4A83BA&\3c&HF0FBFF&\b1\pos(455,293.467)}Michael Arnold\NAshley Barboza
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.88,0:22:01.84,Default,Credits,0,0,0,,{\an9\fad(353,354)\shad0\fnArial\fs10\bord1.5\c&H4A83BA&\3c&HF0FBFF&\b1\pos(443,209.319)}Quality Control:\NTranslation Check:
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.88,0:22:01.84,Default,Credits,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(353,354)\shad0\fnArial\fs10\bord1.5\c&H4A83BA&\3c&HF0FBFF&\b1\pos(455,209.319)}Riley Dalton\NSriram Gurunathan
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.00,0:23:24.47,Default,Sumiyaki,0,0,0,,Oh, look at that! Just as I expected. \NShe's very popular!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.47,0:23:27.76,Default,Sumiyaki,0,0,0,,I'm glad I recommended that she try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.26,0:23:32.24,Default,Sumiyaki,0,0,0,,But if she leverages her assets even more,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.87,0:23:34.44,Default,Sumiyaki,0,0,0,,she'll really shine!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.02,0:23:40.02,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020201&\bord0\pos(318,155)}Episode {\c&H8A80CC&}8{\c&H020201}  That Was Too {\c&HA49F43&}Impressive
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.87,0:23:39.26,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Next time is "That Was Too Impressive."
